// REMOVE when Gaia's generator step lands (PR B16): Lemnos's generated overlay (lemnos-ctl tree) is merged
// into the board's dtb by Gaia with fdtoverlay, and this hand-written gadget DTS is replaced by that overlay.
// Kept until then: the bring-up's gadget port depends on it.
// SPDX-License-Identifier: (GPL-2.0+ OR MIT)
// The ZERO 3E with its USB 2.0 OTG port (usb_host0_xhci) as a USB device, so
// the gadget can be a network function. Carried from dev's gadget DTS.
// Why this DTS, and not the in-tree one: a gadget needs the port in peripheral
// mode; this file changes only that property. (Whether the in-tree DTS leaves it
// in host mode is not checked here.)
#include "rk3566-radxa-zero-3e.dts"

&usb_host0_xhci {
	dr_mode = "peripheral";
};
